  - replication
abstract: "Partial replication and extension of Anarkulova, Cederburg and O'Doherty (2025). The paper rebuilds a 1927-2025 panel of international asset returns (stocks, sovereign bonds, bills, gold and a managed-futures trend-following proxy), reproduces their fixed-equity lifecycle benchmark on public data, and extends the opportunity set to fixed multi-asset portfolios with up to 200% gross exposure."
